\frametitle{Growth Optimization: A Primer}
\begin{columns}
   \begin{column}{0.6\textwidth}
    \begin{itemize}
     \item ``When tomorrow depends on today''
     \item Losses hurt exponentially more
     \item Irreversibility of state transitions makes things even worse (Think Russian Roulette)
     \item Most economic processes are multiplicative
     \begin{itemize}
      \item Capital accumulation
      \item Trust, reputation
      \item Legal cases
     \end{itemize}
     \item Shifting the return distribution upwards, at the smallest cost
    \end{itemize}
   \end{column}
